":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"5qpBxIg0n6jxkHIQHJSoZw","review_id":"1jKjNCaSzwNCN0Tudg270g","date":"2019-03-11T20:58:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.950191080570221,"text_excerpt":"While visiting the WWII Museum, we needed to get off our feet & eat so tried the museum restaurant. To avoid the 20 min wait, we sat at the bar. Two bar tenders gave us great service & the food was all very tasty. I had the kale salad & cup of gumbo. Gumbo had great flavor & the kale salad was yummy with the beets & dressing. My husband ate the French dip sandwich, which was also delicious. I'm glad we didn't try to go somewhere else to eat. We were really happy with our meals & would eat here again."},{"business_id":"5qpBxIg0n6jxkHIQHJSoZw","review_id":"6ZpiH3wJA9aIti2yv2mV7g","date":"2019-09-09T00:17:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9392131567001343,"text_excerpt":"We were here for Saturday brunch and I was impressed with the quality of the food. I had the chicken and waffles with a blueberry syrup on the side, and both the chicken and the waffles were perfectly cooked. My boyfriend enjoyed his cheeseburger, although he said the pulled pork nachos he had there the day before were delicious. The workers were friendly and great, and our waitress was really helpful. Some of the best museum food I've ever had, and a great option so you can spend more time in and support this wonderful museum."},{"business_id":"5qpBxIg0n6jxkHIQHJSoZw","review_id":"LSmha2FrgF_WRAnbOsV4NA","date":"2019-02-21T16:45:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9349397420883179,"text_excerpt":"The American Sector Restaurant & Bar (inside the National WWII Museum). I have to say, based on past experience, there are few food venues I avoid more that museum food service. I am happy to be proven wrong by The American Sector Restaurant & Bar. The restaurant was comfortable, uncluttered, and quiet. Tastefully decorated. The service was top-notch (Thank You, Jay, Great Job!), and the GM checked in with us as well to make sure we were happy. We all enjoyed our food -- when was the last time you saw Frito Pie on a menu? -- and provided a much needed break from perusing the museum. The American Sector Restaurant & Bar (inside the National WWII Museum). I recommend it wholeheartedly. Five..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"5qpBxIg0n6jxkHIQHJSoZw","photo_id":"2zvbOotYS0gVwyC2ajJrGQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2zvbOotYS0gVwyC2ajJrGQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9275180101394653},{"business_id":"5qpBxIg0n6jxkHIQHJSoZw","photo_id":"eJ1tRUXqKCNjfLCU7ihzag","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/eJ1tRUXqKCNjfLCU7ihzag.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8821552991867065},{"business_id":"5qpBxIg0n6jxkHIQHJSoZw","photo_id":"jJmYTi7Op2VETrzmCAWltw","label":"inside","image_